{"D:\\wt\\ssimple5\\vlog\\ssimple5\\voz\\b000_t3.wav": {"text": "This is my mother's furoshiki, a square of blue cotton cloth she carried for 60 years. With this one cloth, she never needed a shopping bag, a gift box, or a roll of wrapping paper. She lived to 101 in Osaka. After 60, she stopped buying nine things, one by one, and she never missed any of them. Today I will tell you all nine. And number nine is the one that kept her comfortable for 40 years on a very small pension when many of her friends were worried every month. One of them she replaced with a big kettle and a handful of roasted barley. Another one she replaced with a square of old cotton cut from my father's shirts. But first, one honest thing. This is not advice from a bank and I am not telling you how to spend your money. This is just how one old woman in Osaka lived, simple and happy, and I am 79 now, and I do every one of these nine things.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.64}, {"w": " mother's", "s": 0.64, "e": 1.16}, {"w": " furoshiki,", "s": 1.16, "e": 2.3}, {"w": " a", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.42}, {"w": " square", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.82}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.82, "e": 3.04}, {"w": " blue", "s": 3.04, "e": 3.32}, {"w": " cotton", "s": 3.32, "e": 3.72}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 3.72, "e": 4.08}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.08, "e": 4.3}, {"w": " carried", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.68}, {"w": " for", "s": 4.68, "e": 4.94}, {"w": " 60", "s": 4.94, "e": 5.4}, {"w": " years.", "s": 5.4, "e": 6.38}, {"w": " With", "s": 6.48, "e": 6.6}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.6, "e": 6.86}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.86, "e": 7.12}, {"w": " cloth,", "s": 7.12, "e": 7.6}, {"w": " she", "s": 7.6, "e": 7.7}, {"w": " never", "s": 7.7, "e": 8.1}, {"w": " needed", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.4}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.4, "e": 8.56}, {"w": " shopping", "s": 8.56, "e": 8.92}, {"w": " bag,", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.66}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.66, "e": 9.74}, {"w": " gift", "s": 9.74, "e": 10.12}, {"w": " 